      "tree": {
        "sha": "bfdce7a9780e8c6ec00e02859df0ad733fb94d46",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/bfdce7a9780e8c6ec00e02859df0ad733fb94d46"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree bfdce7a9780e8c6ec00e02859df0ad733fb94d46\nparent f72537037d3350e2974efd760eaa7b04f820880c\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1787008485 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1787009033 -0700\n\ninit: correct first-run disk space estimate\n\nThe assumed blockchain size is maintained in GiB, but the first-run warning labels it as GB.\nFor pruned nodes, the disk-space check uses the lower prune target while the warning displays the full-chain size.\n\nLabel the value as GiB and round the checked byte estimate up to GiB so the warning describes the selected storage mode.\n\nCo-authored-by: Luke Dashjr <luke-jr+git@utopios.org>\nCo-authored-by: Ava Chow <github@achow101.com>\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQQiU97U54YbP0PlTVgnCd/LLYEwhwUCaoOYCRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQJwnfyy2BMIdG4AD+PkUFxgwexvCOAk+GKH/D\nb7M10EZGG8WkvHm72GZDlH0BAOIkjaABZPh60MRLmbuLGQJEqkb83esmR6WS2626\n5pII\n=lIP0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
      },
